            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.346,
            0.527,
            0.368
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This picture now makes it evident that"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.34,
            0.38,
            0.608,
            0.4
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_4.jpg",
          "content": "1+3+5+7+9+11=36."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.412,
            0.833,
            0.457
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Because such a picture can be made for a square of any size, this explains why adding up odd numbers gives square numbers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.461,
            0.833,
            0.506
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "By drawing a similar picture, can you say what is the sum of the first 10 odd numbers?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.51,
            0.833,
            0.556
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now by imagining a similar picture, or by drawing it partially, as needed, can you say what is the sum of the first 100 odd numbers?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.569,
            0.744,
            0.614
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Another example of such a relation between sequences: Adding up and down",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.619,
            0.498,
            0.64
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us look at the following pattern:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.449,
            0.971,
            0.549,
            0.985
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.239,
            0.649,
            0.296,
            0.669
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_11.jpg",
          "content": "1 = 1"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.239,
            0.672,
            0.371,
            0.691
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_12.jpg",
          "content": "1+2+1=4"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.24,
            0.694,
            0.442,
            0.714
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_13.jpg",
          "content": "1+2+3+2+1=9"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.24,
            0.717,
            0.527,
            0.737
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_14.jpg",
          "content": "1+2+3+4+3+2+1=16"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.24,
            0.74,
            0.599,
            0.76
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_15.jpg",
          "content": "1+2+3+4+5+4+3+2+1=25"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.241,
            0.762,
            0.671,
            0.782
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_6_equation_16.jpg",
          "content": "1+2+3+4+5+6+5+4+3+2+1=36"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.813,
            0.833,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This seems to be giving yet another way of getting the square numbers— by adding the counting numbers up and then down!"
            }
          ]
        },
